## Quick-Reference Checklist

### Service Contracts
- [ ] Service contracts live in `Api/` (repository/service interfaces) and `Api/Data/` (DTOs)
- [ ] All interfaces in `Api/` and `Api/Data/` must carry the `@api` PHPDoc annotation
- [ ] `@api` signals backward-compatibility commitment — breaking changes require a major version bump
- [ ] `di.xml` maps each interface to its concrete implementation via `<preference>`

### DataInterface (DTO)
- [ ] DataInterface = **getters and setters only** — zero business logic
- [ ] Constants define field names (e.g., `const NAME = 'name'`)
- [ ] Must declare `getExtensionAttributes()` / `setExtensionAttributes()` to support extension attributes
- [ ] Concrete model extends `AbstractModel` and implements the DataInterface

### RepositoryInterface
- [ ] Standard methods: `save()`, `getById()`, `getList()`, `delete()`, `deleteById()`
- [ ] `getById()` **MUST throw `NoSuchEntityException`** if entity not found — **NEVER returns null**
- [ ] `save()` throws `CouldNotSaveException` on failure
- [ ] `delete()` throws `CouldNotDeleteException` on failure
- [ ] Repository implementations typically include an **identity cache** (array keyed by ID)

### SearchCriteriaInterface
- [ ] `FilterGroup[]` combined with **AND**; `Filter[]` within a group combined with **OR**
- [ ] Filter fields: `getField()`, `getValue()`, `getConditionType()`
- [ ] Condition types: `eq`, `neq`, `like`, `in`, `nin`, `gt`, `lt`, `gteq`, `lteq`, `null`, `notnull`, `finset` (FIND_IN_SET for multiselect)
- [ ] `SearchCriteriaBuilder::addFilter($field, $value, $conditionType)` = one filter per new group (AND)
- [ ] `SearchCriteriaBuilder::addFilters([filter1, filter2])` = multiple filters in same group (OR)
- [ ] `setPageSize()` and `setCurrentPage()` control pagination (pages are **1-based**)

### SearchResults
- [ ] `getList()` returns `SearchResultsInterface`, **not** an array
- [ ] Call `->getItems()` to get the **array of DataInterface objects**
- [ ] `getTotalCount()` returns total matching records **before pagination** (used for REST pagination headers)
- [ ] `setSearchCriteria()` echoes back the criteria object (required by the interface)

### Extension Attributes
- [ ] Declared in `etc/extension_attributes.xml` with `<extension_attributes for="...">` and `<attribute code="..." type="..."/>`
- [ ] **Generated** by `bin/magento setup:di:compile` — never hand-edit generated files
- [ ] Extension interface class name: `{DataInterface}Extension**Interface**` (auto-generated)
- [ ] Must **manually load** via `afterGetById` / `afterGetList` plugins on the repository
- [ ] **`getList()` does NOT automatically load extension attributes** — you must call `extensionAttributesJoinProcessor->process($collection)` explicitly
- [ ] `extensionAttributesJoinProcessor->process()` must be called **before** `collectionProcessor->process()` in `getList()`
- [ ] `getExtensionAttributes()` can return `null` — always null-check and create a new instance if needed

### Common Exam Traps
- [ ] `getById()` returns `DataInterface`, **not** `?DataInterface` — no nullable return type
- [ ] `getList()` returns `SearchResultsInterface`, **not** `DataInterface[]`
- [ ] Missing `extensionAttributesJoinProcessor->process()` = silently empty extension attributes in `getList()`
- [ ] `addFilters([f1, f2])` = **OR**; two separate `addFilter()` calls = **AND**
- [ ] `TotalCount` ≠ `count(getItems())` when pagination is applied
- [ ] Plugins on repository interfaces must be declared against the **interface**, not the concrete class, in `di.xml`
- [ ] `@api` is documentation only — it does **not** auto-generate REST routes (that's `webapi.xml`)

