## 2. Product Types & Programmatic Creation

### Product Type Matrix

| Type | `type_id` | Class | Key Differences |
|---|---|---|---|
| Simple | `simple` | `Magento\Catalog\Model\Product\Type\Simple` | Standalone, single SKU, physical |
| Configurable | `configurable` | `Magento\ConfigurableProduct\Model\Product\Type\Configurable` | Parent; children are simple products |
| Grouped | `grouped` | `Magento\GroupedProduct\Model\Product\Type\Grouped` | Collection of simples sold together |
| Bundle | `bundle` | `Magento\Bundle\Model\Product\Type` (Bundle) | Customer-assembled; options + selections |
| Virtual | `virtual` | `Magento\Catalog\Model\Product\Type\Virtual` | No shipping; service/subscription |
| Downloadable | `downloadable` | `Magento\Downloadable\Model\Product\Type` (Downloadable) | Virtual + file/link downloads |

### Programmatic Creation: Simple Product

```php
<?php
use Magento\Catalog\Api\Data\ProductInterfaceFactory;
use Magento\Catalog\Api\ProductRepositoryInterface;
use Magento\Catalog\Model\Product\Attribute\Source\Status;
use Magento\Catalog\Model\Product\Visibility;
use Magento\Catalog\Model\Product\Type;

class CreateSimpleProduct
{
    public function __construct(
        private readonly ProductInterfaceFactory $productFactory,
        private readonly ProductRepositoryInterface $productRepository
    ) {}

    public function execute(): void
    {
        $product = $this->productFactory->create();
        $product->setSku('SIMPLE-001');
        $product->setName('My Simple Product');
        $product->setTypeId(Type::TYPE_SIMPLE);      // 'simple'
        $product->setAttributeSetId(4);              // Default attribute set
        $product->setPrice(29.99);
        $product->setStatus(Status::STATUS_ENABLED); // 1
        $product->setVisibility(Visibility::VISIBILITY_BOTH); // 4
        $product->setWeight(1.0);

        // Stock data via extension attributes
        $stockItem = $this->stockItemFactory->create();
        $stockItem->setQty(100);
        $stockItem->setIsInStock(true);

        $extensionAttributes = $product->getExtensionAttributes();
        $extensionAttributes->setStockItem($stockItem);
        $product->setExtensionAttributes($extensionAttributes);

        $this->productRepository->save($product);
    }
}
```

### Programmatic Creation: Configurable Product

```php
<?php
use Magento\Catalog\Api\Data\ProductInterfaceFactory;
use Magento\ConfigurableProduct\Helper\Product\Options\Factory as OptionsFactory;
use Magento\Catalog\Api\ProductRepositoryInterface;
use Magento\ConfigurableProduct\Model\Product\Type\Configurable;

class CreateConfigurableProduct
{
    public function __construct(
        private readonly ProductInterfaceFactory $productFactory,
        private readonly ProductRepositoryInterface $productRepository,
        private readonly OptionsFactory $optionsFactory,
        private readonly \Magento\Catalog\Api\ProductAttributeRepositoryInterface $attributeRepository
    ) {}

    public function execute(): void
    {
        // 1. Create child simple products first
        $childSkus = ['CONF-RED-S', 'CONF-BLUE-S'];
        // ... (create simples as above) ...

        // 2. Load the configurable attribute (e.g., 'color')
        $colorAttr = $this->attributeRepository->get('color');

        // 3. Build configurable options
        $configurableOptions = $this->optionsFactory->create([
            [
                'attribute_id'  => $colorAttr->getAttributeId(),
                'label'         => $colorAttr->getFrontendLabel(),
                'position'      => 0,
                'values'        => [
                    ['value_index' => 55],  // 'Red' option ID
                    ['value_index' => 56],  // 'Blue' option ID
                ],
            ]
        ]);

        // 4. Build the parent configurable
        $configurable = $this->productFactory->create();
        $configurable->setSku('CONF-PARENT-001');
        $configurable->setName('My Configurable Product');
        $configurable->setTypeId(Configurable::TYPE_CODE); // 'configurable'
        $configurable->setAttributeSetId(4);
        $configurable->setStatus(1);
        $configurable->setVisibility(4);

        // 5. Assign configurable options + child associations
        $extensionAttributes = $configurable->getExtensionAttributes();
        $extensionAttributes->setConfigurableProductOptions($configurableOptions);
        $extensionAttributes->setConfigurableProductLinks([/* child product IDs */]);
        $configurable->setExtensionAttributes($extensionAttributes);

        $this->productRepository->save($configurable);
    }
}
```

> **Exam focus:**
> - Configurable product children are **simple products** assigned via `setConfigurableProductLinks()` using **entity IDs**
> - Configurable options reference the **attribute_id** and **option value_index** (not labels)
> - You must create child simples **before** the parent configurable
> - Configurable parent price is typically **0** or empty; price comes from children

### Programmatic Creation: Bundle Product

```php
<?php
use Magento\Bundle\Api\Data\OptionInterfaceFactory;
use Magento\Bundle\Api\Data\LinkInterfaceFactory;
use Magento\Catalog\Model\Product\Type as ProductType;

// Bundle requires BundleOption + BundleOptionLink extension attributes
$bundleOption = $this->bundleOptionFactory->create();
$bundleOption->setTitle('Choose a Size');
$bundleOption->setType('select');   // radio, select, checkbox, multi
$bundleOption->setRequired(true);
$bundleOption->setPosition(1);

$bundleLink = $this->bundleLinkFactory->create();
$bundleLink->setSku('SIMPLE-SMALL');
$bundleLink->setQty(1);
$bundleLink->setPrice(10.00);
$bundleLink->setPriceType(0);  // 0=fixed, 1=percent
$bundleLink->setIsDefault(true);
$bundleLink->setCanChangeQuantity(0);

$bundleOption->setProductLinks([$bundleLink]);

$extensionAttributes = $bundle->getExtensionAttributes();
$extensionAttributes->setBundleProductOptions([$bundleOption]);
$bundle->setExtensionAttributes($extensionAttributes);
$bundle->setPriceType(0); // 0=Fixed, 1=Dynamic
```

### Programmatic Creation: Downloadable Product

```php
<?php
use Magento\Downloadable\Api\Data\LinkInterfaceFactory;
use Magento\Downloadable\Api\Data\SampleInterfaceFactory;
use Magento\Downloadable\Model\Product\Type as DownloadableType;

$link = $this->downloadableLinkFactory->create();
$link->setTitle('Full Download');
$link->setPrice(0.00);
$link->setNumberOfDownloads(5); // 0 = unlimited
$link->setIsShareable(1);
$link->setLinkType('url');      // 'url' or 'file'
$link->setLinkUrl('https://example.com/file.zip');

$extensionAttributes = $product->getExtensionAttributes();
$extensionAttributes->setDownloadableProductLinks([$link]);
$product->setExtensionAttributes($extensionAttributes);
$product->setTypeId(DownloadableType::TYPE_DOWNLOADABLE); // 'downloadable'
```

> **Exam focus:**
> - **Virtual** = no shipping required, no weight; **Downloadable** = virtual + links/samples
> - **Grouped** product links are *not* true children — they are associated products loaded separately; grouped product itself has **no price**
> - **Bundle** price type: `0` = Fixed price, `1` = Dynamic (calculated from selections)
> - All non-simple types use **extension attributes** to carry type-specific data through the repository

