## 4. Category Tree: CategoryManagementInterface

### Interface

```php
namespace Magento\Catalog\Api;

interface CategoryManagementInterface
{
    // Returns the full category tree from a given root
    public function getTree(int $rootCategoryId = null, int $depth = null): CategoryTreeInterface;

    // Moves a category to a new parent
    public function move(int $categoryId, int $parentId, int $afterId = null): bool;

    // Returns count of ALL active categories (no parameter)
    public function getCount(): int;
}
```

### Traversing the Category Tree

```php
<?php
use Magento\Catalog\Api\CategoryManagementInterface;
use Magento\Catalog\Api\Data\CategoryTreeInterface;

class CategoryTreeTraversal
{
    public function __construct(
        private readonly CategoryManagementInterface $categoryManagement
    ) {}

    public function getFullTree(): CategoryTreeInterface
    {
        // Get tree from Default Category (ID 2) with no depth limit
        return $this->categoryManagement->getTree(2, null);
    }

    public function printTree(CategoryTreeInterface $tree, int $depth = 0): void
    {
        $indent = str_repeat('  ', $depth);
        echo $indent . $tree->getName() . ' (ID: ' . $tree->getId() . ')' . PHP_EOL;

        foreach ($tree->getChildrenData() as $child) {
            $this->printTree($child, $depth + 1);
        }
    }

    public function getThirdLevel(): CategoryTreeInterface
    {
        // Get only 3 levels deep
        return $this->categoryManagement->getTree(2, 3);
    }
}
```

### CategoryTreeInterface vs CategoryInterface

| Feature | `CategoryInterface` | `CategoryTreeInterface` |
|---|---|---|
| Source | Repository | Management interface |
| Children | Not included | Included as `getChildrenData()` |
| Usage | Single category CRUD | Tree navigation |
| Path | `getPath()` returns IDs | `getPath()` returns IDs |

> **Exam focus:**
> - `getTree()` returns `CategoryTreeInterface` which has `getChildrenData()` — **not** available on `CategoryInterface`
> - The `$depth` parameter controls recursion depth; `null` = unlimited
> - `move()` changes a category's **parent** and updates `path`, `level`, `position` for the whole subtree

