## 6. Product Links: Related, Upsell, Cross-sell

### Link Types

| Type | Constant | Display Location | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|
| Related | `related` | Product page | "Related Products" block |
| Up-sell | `upsell` | Product page | "You May Also Like" block |
| Cross-sell | `crosssell` | Cart page | "You May Also Be Interested In" |

### LinkManagementInterface

```php
namespace Magento\Catalog\Api;

interface ProductLinkManagementInterface
{
    // Get all linked products of a type
    public function getLinkedItemsByType(string $sku, string $type): array;

    // Set linked products (replaces all existing links of that type)
    public function setProductLinks(string $sku, array $items): bool;
}
```

### Reading Product Links

```php
<?php
use Magento\Catalog\Api\ProductLinkManagementInterface;

class ProductLinkReader
{
    public function __construct(
        private readonly ProductLinkManagementInterface $linkManagement
    ) {}

    public function getRelated(string $sku): array
    {
        return $this->linkManagement->getLinkedItemsByType($sku, 'related');
    }

    public function getUpsells(string $sku): array
    {
        return $this->linkManagement->getLinkedItemsByType($sku, 'upsell');
    }

    public function getCrosssells(string $sku): array
    {
        return $this->linkManagement->getLinkedItemsByType($sku, 'crosssell');
    }
}
```

### Setting Product Links Programmatically

```php
<?php
use Magento\Catalog\Api\Data\ProductLinkInterfaceFactory;
use Magento\Catalog\Api\ProductLinkManagementInterface;

class ProductLinkWriter
{
    public function __construct(
        private readonly ProductLinkManagementInterface $linkManagement,
        private readonly ProductLinkInterfaceFactory $productLinkFactory
    ) {}

    public function setRelatedProducts(string $sku, array $relatedSkus): void
    {
        $links = [];
        $position = 0;

        foreach ($relatedSkus as $relatedSku) {
            $link = $this->productLinkFactory->create();
            $link->setSku($sku);                 // Parent SKU
            $link->setLinkedProductSku($relatedSku);
            $link->setLinkType('related');
            $link->setPosition($position++);
            $links[] = $link;
        }

        // This REPLACES all existing 'related' links for the SKU
        $this->linkManagement->setProductLinks($sku, $links);
    }
}
```

### Via ProductRepository (extension attributes)

```php
// Links are also accessible via product extension attributes
$product = $this->productRepository->get('MY-SKU');
$productLinks = $product->getProductLinks(); // Returns all link types

foreach ($productLinks as $link) {
    echo $link->getLinkType() . ': ' . $link->getLinkedProductSku() . PHP_EOL;
}

// Setting links via repository save
$link = $this->productLinkFactory->create();
$link->setSku('MY-SKU');
$link->setLinkedProductSku('RELATED-SKU');
$link->setLinkType('related');
$link->setPosition(0);

$product->setProductLinks([$link]);
$this->productRepository->save($product);
```

> **Exam focus:**
> - `setProductLinks()` on `LinkManagementInterface` **replaces** all links of that type — not appends
> - Link types are stored in `catalog_product_link_type` table; IDs: related=1, upsell=4, crosssell=5
> - Cross-sell links appear on the **shopping cart page**, not the product page
> - Position attribute on links is stored in `catalog_product_link_attribute_int`

