## Quick-Reference Checklist

### ProductRepositoryInterface

- [ ] `get(sku)` loads by SKU; `getById(id)` loads by entity_id
- [ ] Both share an internal identity map/cache — use `$forceReload=true` (4th param) to bypass
- [ ] `getList()` returns `ProductSearchResultsInterface`; iterate with `->getItems()`
- [ ] Filters in same `addFilter()` call = AND; same FilterGroup array = OR
- [ ] `$storeId` parameter controls store scope; omit for current store, `0` for global
- [ ] `delete()` takes a product object; `deleteById()` takes a SKU string

### Product Types

- [ ] Simple: physical, single SKU, has weight, has stock
- [ ] Configurable: parent only, children are simples, configured via extension attributes
- [ ] Grouped: associated simples, no price on parent, items are separate in cart
- [ ] Bundle: customer assembles from options; price type Fixed(0) or Dynamic(1)
- [ ] Virtual: no shipping/weight; services/memberships
- [ ] Downloadable: virtual + download links/samples
- [ ] Configurable children must be created **before** the parent
- [ ] Configurable uses `setConfigurableProductLinks([entityIds])` + `setConfigurableProductOptions([...])`

### Configurable Children — THE Big Gotcha

- [ ] `getConfigurableProductLinks()` returns **integer IDs**, NOT product objects
- [ ] Children are **not embedded** in the parent product object from the repository
- [ ] Must make a **separate** `getList()` call with `entity_id IN (...)` filter
- [ ] Alternative: `$product->getTypeInstance()->getUsedProducts($product)`
- [ ] `getUsedProducts()` returns `\Magento\Catalog\Model\Product[]` (not `ProductInterface`)

### CategoryRepositoryInterface

- [ ] Methods: `get()`, `save()`, `delete()`, `deleteByIdentifier()` — **no `getList()`**
- [ ] `setIsAnchor(true)` = show products from child categories in collections
- [ ] `setParentId()` determines tree position; path/level auto-calculated on save
- [ ] IDs 1 (Root of Roots) and 2 (Default Category) are system categories

### CategoryManagementInterface

- [ ] `getTree(rootId, depth)` returns `CategoryTreeInterface` with `getChildrenData()`
- [ ] `CategoryInterface` does NOT have `getChildrenData()` — only `CategoryTreeInterface` does
- [ ] `null` depth = unlimited recursion
- [ ] `move(categoryId, parentId)` updates path/level for entire subtree

### ProductCollection

- [ ] `addAttributeToSelect('name')` = JOINs EAV table to fetch value
- [ ] `addAttributeToSelect('*')` = all attributes (expensive!)
- [ ] `addAttributeToFilter()` = filters on EAV attribute value
- [ ] `addFieldToFilter()` = filters on main table / flat table column
- [ ] `addCategoryFilter($categoryObject)` = uses `catalog_category_product_index`
- [ ] `getSize()` = total count without loading all items
- [ ] Condition types: `eq`, `neq`, `gt`, `lt`, `gteq`, `lteq`, `like`, `in`, `nin`, `null`, `notnull`

### Flat Catalog Gotchas

- [ ] Flat catalog is **disabled by default** in Magento 2
- [ ] When enabled: `addAttributeToFilter/Select` queries `catalog_product_flat_X` (per store)
- [ ] Custom EAV JOINs may **break** if attribute not included in flat index
- [ ] Changes to flat require **reindex** to appear
- [ ] Category flat is separate: `catalog_category_flat_store_X`

### Product Links

- [ ] Types: `related` (product page), `upsell` (product page), `crosssell` (**cart page**)
- [ ] `LinkManagementInterface::setProductLinks()` **replaces all** links of that type
- [ ] Links also accessible via `$product->getProductLinks()` (extension attributes path)
- [ ] Link positions stored in `catalog_product_link_attribute_int`

### Product Media

- [ ] Roles: `image` (base), `small_image` (listing), `thumbnail` (cart/related), `swatch_image`
- [ ] One file can be assigned to **multiple roles** simultaneously
- [ ] `setTypes([])` empty array removes all role assignments from an entry
- [ ] `isDisabled(true)` hides from gallery but does **not** delete the file
- [ ] Files stored in `pub/media/catalog/product/{a}/{b}/filename.jpg`
- [ ] `MediaGalleryEntryContentInterface` used for new image uploads (base64 encoded)
- [ ] `ProductAttributeMediaGalleryManagementInterface` provides `create()`, `update()`, `remove()`, `getList()`

### Store Scope

- [ ] Repository loads with `storeId=0` = global/admin scope values
- [ ] `editMode=true` (2nd param) loads admin values regardless of current area
- [ ] Category repository also accepts `storeId` in `get()`

