### 1.4 CartRepositoryInterface

**Namespace:** `Magento\Quote\Api\CartRepositoryInterface`

Manages **quote persistence** — loading and saving quote objects as a whole.

| Method | Signature | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `get` | `get(int $cartId, array $sharedStoreIds = [])` | Load a quote by its ID |
| `getForCustomer` | `getForCustomer(int $customerId, array $sharedStoreIds = [])` | Load active quote for customer |
| `getActive` | `getActive(int $cartId, array $sharedStoreIds = [])` | Load only if quote is active |
| `save` | `save(CartInterface $quote)` | Persist quote changes |
| `delete` | `delete(CartInterface $quote)` | Delete a quote |
| `getList` | `getList(SearchCriteriaInterface $searchCriteria)` | Search quotes |

**Exam focus:**
- `get()` loads **any** quote (active or inactive); `getActive()` throws `NoSuchEntityException` if the quote is not active
- Always call `cartRepository->save($quote)` after modifying quote properties (shipping address, coupon codes, etc.)

```php
<?php
declare(strict_types=1);

use Magento\Quote\Api\CartRepositoryInterface;
use Magento\Quote\Api\Data\AddressInterfaceFactory;

class SetShippingAddressExample
{
    public function __construct(
        private readonly CartRepositoryInterface $cartRepository,
        private readonly AddressInterfaceFactory $addressFactory,
    ) {}

    public function setShippingAddress(int $cartId): void
    {
        $quote = $this->cartRepository->get($cartId);

        $address = $this->addressFactory->create();
        $address->setRegion('California');
        $address->setRegionId(12);
        $address->setCountryId('US');
        $address->setStreet(['123 Main Street']);
        $address->setPostcode('90210');
        $address->setCity('Beverly Hills');
        $address->setFirstname('John');
        $address->setLastname('Doe');
        $address->setTelephone('555-1234');

        $quote->getShippingAddress()->importDataObject($address);
        $quote->getShippingAddress()->setCollectShippingRates(true);
        $quote->getShippingAddress()->collectShippingRates();
        $quote->getShippingAddress()->setShippingMethod('flatrate_flatrate');

        $this->cartRepository->save($quote);
    }
}
```

