## Quick-Reference Checklist

### Repository Pattern
- [ ] Use `RepositoryInterface` (e.g., `ProductRepositoryInterface`) for all CRUD in production
- [ ] `$repo->get($sku)` / `$repo->getById($id)` for loading; `$repo->save($entity)` for saving
- [ ] **Never call `$model->save()` on an entity loaded via repository**
- [ ] `$repo->getList(SearchCriteriaInterface)` returns `SearchResultsInterface` with `getItems()` and `getTotalCount()`
- [ ] `SearchCriteriaBuilder->addFilter($field, $value, $conditionType)` — default condition is `eq`

### Direct Model Pattern (Legacy)
- [ ] `load()`, `setData()`, `save()` on `AbstractModel` — **deprecated, avoid**
- [ ] Bypasses repository plugins and service contract layer
- [ ] Acceptable only in ResourceModel internals, tests, or very constrained migration scenarios

### DataObjectHelper
- [ ] `populateWithArray($dataObject, $array, InterfaceClass::class)` hydrates DTOs from arrays
- [ ] Converts snake_case array keys to camelCase setter calls automatically
- [ ] Handles nested extension attributes recursively

### addFieldToFilter() Conditions
- [ ] `eq` — equal (default for scalar)
- [ ] `neq` — not equal
- [ ] `like` — SQL LIKE with `%` wildcards
- [ ] `in` — IN list; **must use `['in' => [...]]`** — plain arrays create OR, NOT IN
- [ ] `nin` — NOT IN
- [ ] `null` — IS NULL
- [ ] `notnull` — IS NOT NULL
- [ ] `gt`, `gteq`, `lt`, `lteq` — numeric comparisons
- [ ] `from`, `to` — date/range comparisons
- [ ] Multiple calls = AND; array of conditions in one call = OR

### Collection Pagination
- [ ] `setPageSize($n)` — sets LIMIT
- [ ] `setCurPage($n)` — sets OFFSET (1-indexed)
- [ ] `getSize()` — **separate COUNT query, ignores pagination**, returns total matching records
- [ ] `getLastPageNumber()` — total page count
- [ ] EAV attributes: `addAttributeToFilter()` + `addAttributeToSelect()`; flat columns: `addFieldToFilter()`

### Mass Operations
- [ ] Iterate collection + `$repo->save()` each item = plugin-safe bulk update
- [ ] `$connection->update($table, $data, $where)` = direct SQL bulk update (bypasses all ORM)
- [ ] Direct SQL skips cache, index, events — only for migrations

### Transaction Handling
- [ ] Methods: `$connection->beginTransaction()` / `->commit()` / `->rollBack()`
- [ ] `$connection` comes from `ResourceConnection::getConnection()`
- [ ] Always wrap in try/catch — `rollBack()` in catch, re-throw exception
- [ ] Nested `beginTransaction()` creates SQL savepoints internally
- [ ] Rollback undoes DB writes only — cache and external side effects are NOT reversed

### Custom Entity CRUD
- [ ] Model `_construct()` calls `$this->_init(ResourceModel::class)` — links model to resource
- [ ] ResourceModel `_construct()` calls `$this->_init('table_name', 'primary_key')`
- [ ] Collection `_construct()` calls `$this->_init(Model::class, ResourceModel::class)`
- [ ] Repository uses `$this->resourceModel->save($model)` (not `$model->save()`)
- [ ] `CollectionProcessorInterface::process($searchCriteria, $collection)` auto-applies all filters/sorts/pagination
- [ ] Register preference in `di.xml`: interface → implementation for all Api interfaces

### Data Patches
- [ ] Implement `DataPatchInterface` with `apply()`, `getDependencies()`, `getAliases()`
- [ ] Tracked in `patch_list` table — runs **once only** per installation
- [ ] Place in `Setup/Patch/Data/` directory
- [ ] Run with `bin/magento setup:upgrade`
- [ ] **Must call `$appState->emulateAreaCode()` in CLI context** when loading entities that require area
- [ ] Use `$productRepository->save($product)` inside patches — not `$product->save()`
- [ ] Delete row from `patch_list` to force re-run during development
- [ ] Use `setCurrentStore(Store::DEFAULT_STORE_ID)` to avoid store-scoped data issues
- [ ] Process large datasets in pages (setPageSize + loop) to avoid memory exhaustion
